{"about_the_game":"<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/Header_LearningCurve.png?t=1748981145\" /></div>Midnight Mayhem features some complex mechanics. If you're looking for something quick and casual, this may not be the game for you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/Header_Abilities.png?t=1748981145\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/Abilities.gif?t=1748981145\" /></div><strong>Be prepared for anything as the monsters abilities keep evolving and changing!</strong><br>The monster player has limited control over their next ability so they will also have to think quickly to make the best use of them!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/Header_MonsterInvisible.png?t=1748981145\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/InvisibleInShadows.gif?t=1748981145\" /></div><strong>Hide in the shadows and kill your prey one by one!</strong><br>Stalk your prey from a distance and stay as close as possible without being seen. Then strike before they have time to react!<br><br>You're completely invisible in the shadows. Avoid light at all cost!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/Header_Gadgets.png?t=1748981145\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/Gadgets.gif?t=1748981145\" /></div><strong>Use various improvised weapons and gadgets to locate and defend from the monster. </strong><br>Use the right tool at the right time to shift the tides!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/Header_HumanObjective.png?t=1748981145\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/HumanObjective.gif?t=1748981145\" /></div><strong>Work together to survive and banish the monster once and for all!</strong><br>Don't forget to check the shadows and keep a light source close by, once it decides to attack it's already too late!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/Header_MonsterVS.png?t=1748981145\" /></div>Work with your friends or try to brutally murder them!<br><br>The game supports proximity chat with other effects like echo in certain locations.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/Header_JoinDiscord.png?t=1748981145\" /></div>Join the Discord using the button on the right side of the page!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Proximity chat<br></li><li>2-6 players<br></li><li>18 Strange monster abilities<br></li><li>4 Different maps<br></li><li>5 Main weapons<br></li><li>6 Different gadgets and tools<br></li><li>4 Modulators to switch up the gameplay<br></li><li>11 Unlockable masks to customize your character<br></li><li>6 Emotes<br></li><li>Xbox controller support</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2890060?t=1748981145","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748981145","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/7aa4a9a1c2